OL,3,GNEWSAMore council homes to be fitted
OL,4,Awith solar panels
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300 more council homes in the
OL,7,FGoole area are to be fitted with solar
OL,8,Fpanels in a bid to cut tenants' energy
OL,9,Fbills and reduce carbon emissions.
OL,11,FAs part of an investment programme by
OL,12,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council during
OL,13,Fthe 2026-27 financial year, solar
OL,14,Fpanels, energy-efficient LED lighting
OL,15,Fand improved loft insulation will be
OL,16,Finstalled.
OL,18,FOnce the work is completed, around
OL,19,FMarch 2027, more than 400 council homes
OL,20,Fin the town will have solar panels,
OL,21,Falmost a third of the council-owned
OL,22,Fproperties in the area.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
