OL,3,GNEWSAMore council homes to be fitted
OL,4,Awith solar panels
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe solar panels will also allow
OL,7,Ftenants to use renewable electricity
OL,8,Fgenerated at their home, with surplus
OL,9,Felectricity able to be exported to the
OL,10,FNational Grid.
